4
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.600
What do you believe in. Carlos?

5
00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.240
I don't understand. I don't speak English.

6
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.320
Yes. you do.

7
00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.400
I speak English.

8
00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.960
I speak good English.

9
00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.160
Misty…

10
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.480
I believe in love.

11
00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.400
Love is all we have.

12
00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.000
Two people.

13
00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:13.520
Connection.

14
00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.320
What are you doing?

15
00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.320
Do you know who we are?

16
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.040
Who is our boss?

17
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.320
Shut your mouth!

18
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.440
Wichser.

19
00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.160
Please. brother. let me go.

20
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.560
Pray to your god.

21
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.280
Are you English?

22
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.040
Can you talk to them? Tell them I work for the cartel.

23
00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.360
- From Guinea-Bissau. This is our route. - Your time has come.

24
00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.240
Accept it.

25
00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.720
Ask God for help.

26
00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.680
- Pray. - I'm a drug courier.

27
00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.240
I don't pray!

28
00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.960
And it's not over for me.

29
00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.360
Come on. man. Where are you from?

30
00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.120
Who are you?

31
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.200
No. please don't. I don't want to die.

32
00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.280
Don't kill me!

33
00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:57.440
Get her in the truck. Now!

34
00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:00.680
Beilung!

35
00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.280
In the back.

36
00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.280
The!

37
00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.000
- Come in. - I need to get something.

38
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.640
- Get in. damn it. - Please. it's just a photo.

39
00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.480
It's in my car.

40
00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.520
If you lie. I'll kill you.

41
00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.040
Do you see.

42
00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:22.960
Move.

43
00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.520
The. the.

44
00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.840
Get in the damn car.

45
00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.640
- Drive. - Where to?

46
00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.440
Just drive.

47
00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.080
Caucasus Mountains Russia

48
00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.560
a Russian smuggling route

49
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.960
The boxes belong to the contraband.

50
00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.640
I wasn't told that.

51
00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.000
There are two of them.

52
00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.440
Nobody told me that…

53
00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.680
what's in the boxes?

54
00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.880
My name is Oksana Shirokova.

55
00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.680
Do you know the name?

56
00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:46.000
Then you should know that you shouldn't ask questions...

57
00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.400
…but do what you're told.

58
00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.280
Listen.

59
00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:01.320
Remember. they should always be separate from each other.

60
00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.280
Understood?

61
00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.320
I won't disappoint you.

62
00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.840
You have two days.

63
00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.640
Where did you take the goods?

64
00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.120
Beirut.

65
00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.520
I thought to Libya.

66
00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.360
- The drugs are for Europe. right? - Normally. yes... but not today.

67
00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.920
We came from Bissau via Mali to Algeria…

68
00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.680
…then Libya. then I will be flown to Beirut.

69
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.760
This is no ordinary trip.

70
00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.880
Go to Libya. but not to the plane.

71
00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:20.520
- Take me to Benghazi. - I can't.

72
00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.720
You will.

73
00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.040
I just saved your life.

74
00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.760
You owe me something.

75
00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:40.240
Are they gendarmes or military?

76
00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.960
- Gendarmes. I think. - Do you know them?

77
00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.760
Does the cartel also pay them?

78
00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.600
If you save me. part of the goods will be yours.

79
00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.240
Don't get out.

80
00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.600
Don't say a word.

81
00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.360
Are you letting me down?

82
00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.680
…I'll shoot you through the seat.

83
00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.520
Into the spine.

84
00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.920
Stop.

85
00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.080
Captain Septi.

86
00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.240
Max…

87
00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.720
…from Bissau.

88
00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.040
What is that?

89
00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:23.800
What is this. Max?

90
00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.400
Where is your car?

91
00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.440
Uh. we… nous…

92
00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.160
uh. meeting…

93
00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.120
Islamist fighters?

94
00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.200
Yes.

95
00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.680
Uh. peng. peng. peng.

96
00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:43.920
Uh. my car… my car is broken.

97
00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.040
I had to take this truck.

98
00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.400
My partner Carlos…

99
00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.040
…to.

100
00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.000
That was a fucking cauchemar. mate.

101
00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.720
Nightmare.

102
00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.400
For you.

103
00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.440
Here.

104
00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.160
I think you have a problem.

105
00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.120
Was?

106
00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.720
Max. me?

107
00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:14.840
- Yeah. what's wrong with that? - Nothing.

108
00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:17.760
Max.

109
00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.960
Do you think you're Mad Max. Max?

110
00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.880
Driving through the desert.

111
00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.280
deliver drugs. do crazy stuff. right?

112
00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.760
No. I don't.

113
00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.080
What's your name?

114
00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.720
Fahr.

115
00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.680
Only AK ammunition. Caliber 7.62.

116
00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:07.000
One side fired. not the narcos.

117
00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.560
And not a jihadist.

118
00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:11.120
Of course. Sherlock. I see he's not here.

119
00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:17.200
Kidnapping. Kill the narcos. steal the equipment. and then the twist.

120
00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.920
He kills his own people.

121
00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.640
I'm telling you. this jerk is evil.

122
00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.880
No loyalty. he's a rat.

123
00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.720
Head north… maybe Benghazi.

124
00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.800
We almost had him.

125
00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.920
I've been after that jerk for years.

126
00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.240
Just a matter of time. huh?

127
00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.040
Okay. what now?

128
00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.640
Tee.

129
00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.640
A storm is brewing.

130
00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.880
Was that one of the Russian boxes?

131
00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.000
No.

132
00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.800
The! The! The!

133
00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:28.320
Thank God. The witch would have killed us all.

134
00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.280
Keep going.

135
00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.480
I don't see the way.

136
00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.960
When does your flight to Beirut leave?

137
00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.120
Tomorrow evening.

138
00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.040
- And if you miss him? - I'll be killed.

139
00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.400
This is not good.

140
00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.520
Are you a jihadist?

141
00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.720
You don't even know what jihad means.

142
00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.800
Yes. I know that.

143
00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.920
Kill everyone who doesn't believe the same as you.

144
00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.000
No.

145
00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.920
Jihad means problems.

146
00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.200
It can be anything.

147
00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.920
Earning money. starting a family. personal struggles that each of us

148
00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.200
with the trials that Allah imposes on us.

149
00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:34.640
Was that a test? From God? When you shot your friends?

150
00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.080
The way you pass the exams.

151
00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.600
decides whether you are righteous or damned.

152
00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.520
Why her death?

153
00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.800
I am a damned one.

154
00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.920
Of…

155
00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.880
you are a supplier.

156
00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.560
You could work for Amazon.

157
00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.360
They don't pay that well.

158
00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.880
I am not a supplier.

159
00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.520
- I'm a drug courier. - You're a shitty delivery driver.

160
00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.040
- Accept that. - I don't just smuggle drugs.

161
00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.000
Not?

162
00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.320
No.

163
00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:15.400
Also antiques.

164
00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.360
That's why I'm going to Beirut.

165
00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.280
What kind of antiques?

166
00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.560
The statue.

167
00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:24.480
The statue?

168
00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:29.680
Guinea Bissau West Africa

169
00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.240
African headquarters of a drug cartel

170
00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.320
Small statues. Very valuable.

171
00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.280
The payment... is the delivery.

172
00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.480
You go to Beirut and get the statues.

173
00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.200
You take them to Marrakesh.

174
00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.320
Morocco? Why Morocco?

175
00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:51.480
- Why are they asking. Max? - I want to know what I'm doing. Danny.

176
00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.080
You do what I tell you.

177
00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:57.120
The statues must be transported separately.

178
00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:59.000
Two statues…

179
00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.160
…you and Carlos. two men.

180
00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:05.240
- Why separate? - Because Antonio Alam wants it that way.

181
00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.640
He is the boss.

182
00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:10.880
Have fun.

183
00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.360
- Talk to Miguel. okay? - Do you want a girl before you go?

184
00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.520
No. man. Thanks.

185
00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:20.720
It's all ok.

186
00:16:58.760 --> 00:16:59.920
Didn't sleep?

187
00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.520
No.

188
00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.680
I don't sleep much.

189
00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.000
This is not good.

190
00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.080
Clean the windows.

191
00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.000
When I saw you outside. I thought you were praying.

192
00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.320
I don't pray anymore.

193
00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.480
Then why should I pray? When you almost killed me?

194
00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.320
People like to pray before they die.

195
00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.040
I don't believe in God.

196
00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.880
Religion. none of that shit.

197
00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:42.920
What do you think?

198
00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.440
I believe in love.

199
00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.320
Who you love?

200
00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.480
I love my girlfriend.

201
00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.040
That's nice. isn't it?

202
00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:02.680
You were lucky there.

203
00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.560
I tell her that all the time.

204
00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:08.720
I knew it the moment I saw her.

205
00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.720
What is your girl's name?

206
00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.560
Laetitia.

207
00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.480
Is she in Guinea-Bissau?

208
00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:18.560
No.

209
00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.320
No. she is in Spain.

210
00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.440
I had to come here to work for the cartel.

211
00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.840
Where are you from? From the north?

212
00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.520
Damn. you're exhausting.

213
00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.000
You are English.

214
00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.480
- You can admit that. - Not anymore.

215
00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:39.880
What do you think?

216
00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.240
I am stateless. No passport.

217
00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.600
You can't go home?

218
00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.440
- Never? - Never.

219
00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:54.960
What do you see there?

220
00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.040
Nothing.

221
00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:01.240
- Sure? - Get in.

222
00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.360
Rein.

223
00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:34.040
Why do you want to go to Benghazi? Benghazi is a place to disappear.

224
00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.680
Do you want that?

225
00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:38.000
Just take me there. That's all you need to know.

226
00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.040
I know that Benghazi is our target.

227
00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:43.440
But there is an oasis that the Bedouins use.

228
00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:46.600
From there I get a ride to Benghazi.

229
00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.840
- If you want. - Take me to Benghazi.

230
00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.600
Yes. ready.

231
00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.840
No problem.

232
00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:15.280
They must remain separate.

233
00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:16.840
Yes I know.

234
00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.240
This is valuable Russian cargo.

235
00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.240
Do you know what it is?

236
00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.720
To you they are statues.

237
00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.920
You are safe with me.

238
00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.600
- Will you tell me your name? - No.

239
00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.000
- You're not Jihadi John. are you? - He's dead.

240
00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.640
Oh. yes. That's true.

241
00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.160
Jihadi John…

242
00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.080
…is fucking dead.

243
00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.560
A bomb hit his fucking skull.

244
00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.760
- You talk a lot. don't you? - I need a name for you.

245
00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:57.400
I could call you jihadi John 2.

246
00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.120
- I'll call you jj. - You don't.

247
00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:03.600
If you don't tell me. I have to.

248
00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.160
- I have no choice. - Slow down.

249
00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.160
What are you doing?

250
00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.560
We need gasoline.

251
00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.000
What do you think happened?

252
00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.160
They were killed.

253
00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.920
From people like you?

254
00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.160
Perhaps.

255
00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.240
Maybe they killed the people who smuggled them.

256
00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:11.520
- Do you have anything? - A little. We need more.

257
00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.920
Okay. let's go.

258
00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:15.600
I don't know how far we'll get.

259
00:22:58.240 --> 00:22:59.320
It's okay.

260
00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:01.680
It's okay.

261
00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.560
We'll clean this up. boy.

262
00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:14.960
We'll get you something to eat.

263
00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:19.880
You don't understand a word. do you?

264
00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.600
Whatever you say.

265
00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:25.880
that will hurt like hell.

266
00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:42.800
We need more gasoline.

267
00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:45.960
I said I know an oasis nearby.

268
00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:47.440
We can take him there…

269
00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:51.320
…with the money in your backpack you could come to Europe.

270
00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.520
And I'm going to Beirut. I could still make my flight.

271
00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:00.120
Okay.

272
00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:01.200
Go there.

273
00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.000
Beirut Lebanon

274
00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:21.000
a turning point

275
00:25:11.920 --> 00:25:13.000
You are ready.

276
00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:19.160
My son…

277
00:25:25.840 --> 00:25:26.880
My son…

278
00:25:31.600 --> 00:25:34.440
We belong to Allah. and to Him we shall return.

279
00:25:36.120 --> 00:25:38.520
He was a good son.

280
00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:44.960
What do we do now?

281
00:25:51.080 --> 00:25:52.640
The Brit.

282
00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:57.320
He will pay for this with his life.

283
00:26:06.040 --> 00:26:07.960
Sahara. Libya

284
00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:09.960
an oasis

285
00:26:29.400 --> 00:26:30.640
How you do that?

286
00:26:31.760 --> 00:26:33.160
Is someone behind me?

287
00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:43.400
So?

288
00:26:43.480 --> 00:26:46.280
There are Bedouins here who can take him to Benghazi.

289
00:26:47.280 --> 00:26:49.560
And then? Sell him on the slave market?

290
00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:51.640
He can go from there to Europe.

291
00:26:52.200 --> 00:26:53.400
You can also go.

292
00:26:55.320 --> 00:26:56.680
I'm not going with him.

293
00:26:56.760 --> 00:26:59.160
Then you can only give him a chance.

294
00:27:08.600 --> 00:27:10.440
You are on your own.

295
00:27:13.360 --> 00:27:15.200
I can't do anything more for you.

296
00:27:18.360 --> 00:27:19.600
Trying to survive.

297
00:27:22.000 --> 00:27:23.000
Hey.

298
00:27:33.680 --> 00:27:35.680
No. what are you doing? No. stop.

299
00:27:40.080 --> 00:27:41.080
Go.

300
00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:44.920
Get lost.

301
00:27:51.240 --> 00:27:52.240
Come on.

302
00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:53.720
Let's go.

303
00:28:02.760 --> 00:28:03.760
Worth it.

304
00:28:37.920 --> 00:28:40.000
Did you kill children before?

305
00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:41.880
One shot?

306
00:28:42.440 --> 00:28:44.680
Strapped a suicide bomb to someone?

307
00:28:44.760 --> 00:28:46.240
Yes. that makes sense.

308
00:28:46.320 --> 00:28:49.480
You try to save the child to make amends.

309
00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:50.640
As I said.

310
00:28:51.120 --> 00:28:52.240
God sends trials.

311
00:28:52.920 --> 00:28:54.040
Damn right.

312
00:28:57.840 --> 00:28:59.360
You have to decide.

313
00:28:59.840 --> 00:29:01.560
We can't stay here forever.

314
00:29:02.960 --> 00:29:04.520
Tomorrow I'm going to Benghazi.

315
00:29:06.120 --> 00:29:07.280
You go your way...

316
00:29:08.080 --> 00:29:10.520
...deliver your drugs. go to Beirut.

317
00:29:11.520 --> 00:29:14.440
I'll take the money and make sure he comes to Europe.

318
00:29:18.560 --> 00:29:19.640
If that's what you want.

319
00:29:40.200 --> 00:29:41.840
Thank you. You didn't kill me.

320
00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.200
It's okay.

321
00:29:45.560 --> 00:29:46.960
I owe you something for that.

322
00:30:09.360 --> 00:30:10.480
Go.

323
00:30:12.120 --> 00:30:14.160
- Come on. you fucking thing. - Move!

324
00:30:14.240 --> 00:30:15.240
I'll try. man.

325
00:30:15.320 --> 00:30:16.720
The!

326
00:30:18.880 --> 00:30:20.680
Exit!

327
00:30:22.080 --> 00:30:23.680
Exit!

328
00:30:27.760 --> 00:30:28.800
Exit!

329
00:30:41.520 --> 00:30:43.360
Did you kill my son?

330
00:31:09.760 --> 00:31:11.400
We have welcomed you.

331
00:31:12.160 --> 00:31:14.440
We treated you like one of us.

332
00:31:15.600 --> 00:31:18.280
My son saw you as a brother.

333
00:31:21.440 --> 00:31:22.640
You betrayed him.

334
00:31:27.000 --> 00:31:29.760
You are a traitor.

335
00:32:58.360 --> 00:32:59.760
You are a devil.

336
00:33:38.120 --> 00:33:39.880
The Bedouins would have been safe.

337
00:33:43.480 --> 00:33:45.280
I should have left him in the truck.

338
00:33:47.280 --> 00:33:49.080
His death was planned this way.

339
00:33:49.160 --> 00:33:51.120
- Nothing is planned. - Yes. everything.

340
00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:55.760
I'll know when my death is near. And so will you.

341
00:34:13.520 --> 00:34:14.960
The delivery is gone.

342
00:34:16.600 --> 00:34:17.840
They burned them.

343
00:34:20.040 --> 00:34:21.360
It should be a means of payment…

344
00:34:22.200 --> 00:34:24.720
…for the statues my boss bought in Beirut.

345
00:34:24.800 --> 00:34:26.640
Then don't go to Beirut.

346
00:34:26.720 --> 00:34:28.800
Without cargo. the cartel will hunt you down.

347
00:34:29.400 --> 00:34:31.560
I work for them. I have no choice.

348
00:34:31.640 --> 00:34:33.400
They might think you're dead.

349
00:34:33.480 --> 00:34:35.080
Your chance to dive in.

350
00:34:35.160 --> 00:34:36.560
They always find you.

351
00:34:37.560 --> 00:34:39.200
During the exchange of fire you ran

352
00:34:39.680 --> 00:34:41.400
and hid at the truck.

353
00:34:46.000 --> 00:34:47.840
You're a coward. Max. huh?

354
00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:52.240
Are you afraid of violence?

355
00:34:53.760 --> 00:34:55.920
As a drug dealer. you are afraid of violence.

356
00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:58.560
I'm just a driver. I don't kill people.

357
00:34:59.320 --> 00:35:00.480
I don't have to.

358
00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:02.760
And I won't.

359
00:35:06.600 --> 00:35:08.080
I am not like you.

360
00:35:09.240 --> 00:35:10.640
You kill everyone.

361
00:35:14.040 --> 00:35:15.640
I didn't kill you.

362
00:35:16.920 --> 00:35:18.280
And why not?

363
00:35:27.280 --> 00:35:30.360
No. come on. tell me. You could have killed me.

364
00:35:30.440 --> 00:35:33.400
You could have taken everything - the coke. the money.

365
00:35:33.480 --> 00:35:36.040
You changed your mind. You looked up at the sky.

366
00:35:36.120 --> 00:35:39.040
and changed your mind. What was it? A sign?

367
00:35:39.120 --> 00:35:40.800
- A sign? - Yes. a sign.

368
00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:43.320
From Allah… whatever.

369
00:35:43.400 --> 00:35:44.400
What was it?

370
00:35:46.520 --> 00:35:47.560
It was a drone.

371
00:35:47.640 --> 00:35:48.640
A drone?

372
00:35:48.720 --> 00:35:49.960
Like this one?

373
00:35:52.520 --> 00:35:53.720
Run.

374
00:35:56.560 --> 00:35:59.040
Oh. now I've got you. you jerk.

375
00:36:01.600 --> 00:36:03.760
A damn drone?

376
00:36:03.840 --> 00:36:07.600
- I thought you saw an angel. - I don't see any angels. just drones.

377
00:36:07.680 --> 00:36:09.520
- What are you doing? - I'll get you.

378
00:36:14.320 --> 00:36:16.240
- What? What's going on? - The sun.

379
00:36:16.960 --> 00:36:18.560
Shit.

380
00:36:27.800 --> 00:36:28.920
Come on!

381
00:36:33.880 --> 00:36:35.880
I thought you didn't pray anymore.

382
00:36:50.720 --> 00:36:51.800
Damn it!

383
00:36:51.880 --> 00:36:53.720
Don't stop. I can see them!

384
00:36:58.600 --> 00:36:59.640
What was it?

385
00:36:59.720 --> 00:37:00.720
A bird.

386
00:37:02.960 --> 00:37:03.960
An eagle.

387
00:37:07.080 --> 00:37:08.760
- Drive! - Okay!

388
00:37:08.840 --> 00:37:11.200
Let's see how well you wankers know the desert.

389
00:37:20.880 --> 00:37:22.960
Shit. drive!

390
00:37:24.880 --> 00:37:26.640
- Who's chasing you? - Someone with a drone.

391
00:37:26.720 --> 00:37:29.120
- Who has drones? - Lots of people. they're cheap.

392
00:37:29.200 --> 00:37:31.000
Armies have drones.

393
00:37:34.040 --> 00:37:35.360
Damn it.

394
00:37:43.480 --> 00:37:45.880
- Did we lose them? - I don't see anything.

395
00:37:45.960 --> 00:37:48.720
Perhaps the bird was a sign. The eagle.

396
00:37:48.800 --> 00:37:50.800
- A sign from God. - For what?

397
00:37:50.880 --> 00:37:53.480
That you should come with me to Beirut to get the statues.

398
00:37:57.600 --> 00:38:00.280
- I'm not going to Beirut. - What else do you want to do?

399
00:38:00.800 --> 00:38:01.800
I don't know it.

400
00:38:02.520 --> 00:38:06.000
It's a two-man job. Me and Carlos. The one who was killed.

401
00:38:06.080 --> 00:38:09.320
Maybe you owe me something and should help me.

402
00:38:09.400 --> 00:38:10.680
I don't owe you anything.

403
00:38:12.160 --> 00:38:13.960
A simple job. very quick.

404
00:38:14.040 --> 00:38:16.320
In and out. You and me.

405
00:38:19.200 --> 00:38:21.920
The bird was not a sign from God to go to Beirut.

406
00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:24.160
No. but he answered your prayers.

407
00:38:30.040 --> 00:38:31.240
How do you get there?

408
00:38:55.320 --> 00:38:56.480
Between…

409
00:38:57.320 --> 00:38:58.480
…my friend.

410
00:38:59.200 --> 00:39:00.480
Do we fly with it?

411
00:39:01.400 --> 00:39:04.040
- Through the night? - Yes. you can sleep.

412
00:39:04.120 --> 00:39:05.160
We arrive early.

413
00:39:13.640 --> 00:39:16.800
We were attacked. The shipment is gone. that's true.

414
00:39:16.880 --> 00:39:20.480
But I say. you saved me. The cartel is sending other cargo.

415
00:39:20.560 --> 00:39:22.720
We still have to get the statues and get out of here.

416
00:39:23.320 --> 00:39:25.440
- Do you think they believe that? - Yes.

417
00:39:25.520 --> 00:39:27.280
Why not?

418
00:39:27.360 --> 00:39:30.360
No one from the cartel will be there and I am very credible.

419
00:39:30.480 --> 00:39:31.480
Credible?

420
00:39:31.920 --> 00:39:32.920
Is that you?

421
00:40:01.920 --> 00:40:02.920
Hello.

422
00:40:03.520 --> 00:40:04.520
Good morning.

423
00:40:05.160 --> 00:40:06.720
It's bottom left.

424
00:40:06.800 --> 00:40:07.840
THANKS.

425
00:40:10.000 --> 00:40:11.520
In and out. remember?

426
00:40:11.880 --> 00:40:14.320
- And let me do the talking. - Yes. yes.

427
00:40:26.120 --> 00:40:27.160
Danny.

428
00:40:28.240 --> 00:40:29.600
What are you doing here?

429
00:40:29.680 --> 00:40:30.960
You had trouble?

430
00:40:33.520 --> 00:40:35.080
Yes.

431
00:40:35.160 --> 00:40:36.400
We met jihadists.

432
00:40:37.000 --> 00:40:38.320
They stole the shipment.

433
00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:41.600
Carlos died in the process.

434
00:40:46.360 --> 00:40:48.640
Why did I have to hear that from the gendarmes?

435
00:40:49.080 --> 00:40:50.160
Why not from you?

436
00:40:52.880 --> 00:40:54.040
I lost my phone.

437
00:40:54.640 --> 00:40:56.400
How should I speak to you?

438
00:40:58.320 --> 00:41:00.560
I wanted to stick to the plan.

439
00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:01.960
Get the statues of Alam.

440
00:41:02.520 --> 00:41:03.720
That was important to me.

441
00:41:05.160 --> 00:41:08.640
It's important. How are you going to pay for the statues without delivery?

442
00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:11.200
And who the hell is that?

443
00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.520
This is yy.

444
00:41:12.600 --> 00:41:13.760
He saved my life.

445
00:41:16.960 --> 00:41:18.000
Saved your life?

446
00:41:19.040 --> 00:41:20.120
That's not my name.

447
00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:21.920
I saved his life.

448
00:41:46.040 --> 00:41:47.480
Danny. come on. man.

449
00:41:47.560 --> 00:41:49.000
You can't kill him.

450
00:41:49.080 --> 00:41:50.320
Get out of the way.

451
00:41:52.000 --> 00:41:53.200
Drop it. Danny.

452
00:41:53.280 --> 00:41:56.800
- Max. what the hell are you doing? - I'm serious.

453
00:41:59.480 --> 00:42:01.080
What will you do. Max?

454
00:42:03.680 --> 00:42:05.040
Are you going to kill me?

455
00:42:05.800 --> 00:42:07.320
You fucking coward.

456
00:42:08.880 --> 00:42:10.280
Are you going to shoot me?

457
00:42:16.880 --> 00:42:18.160
Holy shit!

458
00:42:21.160 --> 00:42:22.360
You bastard!

459
00:42:24.520 --> 00:42:25.520
Thanks.

460
00:42:27.200 --> 00:42:28.440
Where are the statues?

461
00:42:36.000 --> 00:42:37.360
There must be two.

462
00:42:39.240 --> 00:42:40.760
We'll take them with us.

463
00:42:41.680 --> 00:42:43.720
Don't look at him. do it.

464
00:42:50.280 --> 00:42:54.120
You tried to kill us. so we're taking your statues.

465
00:42:54.200 --> 00:42:57.040
If you want them back. you have to pay us.

466
00:42:57.120 --> 00:42:58.680
You're going to die. coño.

467
00:42:59.920 --> 00:43:01.040
We all will.

468
00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:03.080
Get the other one.

469
00:43:07.600 --> 00:43:08.600
Hurry up!

470
00:43:09.840 --> 00:43:10.840
No movement!

471
00:43:15.480 --> 00:43:16.600
Don't take it. Please.

472
00:43:17.440 --> 00:43:18.440
Worth it.

473
00:43:19.840 --> 00:43:22.080
- Keep them two meters apart. - Max. go.

474
00:43:23.000 --> 00:43:24.080
Max.

475
00:43:25.480 --> 00:43:26.800
We're not finished yet.

476
00:43:38.400 --> 00:43:39.920
You can't shoot.

477
00:43:40.920 --> 00:43:42.880
The bags could explode.

478
00:43:44.360 --> 00:43:45.400
Shit!

479
00:43:45.480 --> 00:43:46.560
They contain uranium.

480
00:43:47.520 --> 00:43:48.520
Nuclear fuel.

481
00:43:49.960 --> 00:43:51.600
The whole city explodes.

482
00:44:27.040 --> 00:44:27.880
Next time…

483
00:44:27.960 --> 00:44:29.480
A quick job? In. out.

484
00:44:29.560 --> 00:44:31.160
Dr. cassandra Bryce?

485
00:44:31.240 --> 00:44:33.440
I'm from the drug squad here in Beirut.

486
00:44:33.520 --> 00:44:36.720
I have information for which I need your nuclear knowledge.

487
00:44:36.800 --> 00:44:38.040
What the hell is this?

488
00:44:38.120 --> 00:44:40.920
My name is Antonio Alam.

489
00:44:41.000 --> 00:44:42.200
The boss of the cartel.

490
00:44:42.280 --> 00:44:44.240
Listen carefully. Max.

491
00:44:44.320 --> 00:44:47.680
The metal in the boxes is uranium.

492
00:44:48.280 --> 00:44:51.360
My source said it's 50 kilos of uranium.

493
00:44:51.440 --> 00:44:52.320
For a bomb.

494
00:44:52.400 --> 00:44:54.760
- A dirty bomb? - A Hiroshima bomb.

495
00:45:34.840 --> 00:45:36.840
Subtitles By: Jessica young

496
